 "notes": "Verifier I, wave 4 (batch I, I02). Printed: 'Whenever this creature or another creature you control dies, if it had a +1/+1 counter on it, create a 2/2 white Knight creature token with vigilance.' The Lieutenant itself has NO counter and stays alive. Your counterless Plain Bear dies: no Knight. The opponent's Bear with a counter dies: not a creature you control, no Knight. Your Charge Bear (two charge counters, no +1/+1 counter) dies: no Knight, the counter must be a +1/+1 one. Your OTHER creature with a +1/+1 counter (Counter Bear, 3/3) dies: exactly one 2/2 Knight with vigilance."
